mai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833230/extras/75369e5eaf8df742fc93f4fd5e75b2c0.webm?t=1769092566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833230/extras/75369e5eaf8df742fc93f4fd5e75b2c0.mp4?t=1769092566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This sequel retains many of the features of the original game but I've added more interaction during the matches, plus more gyms, the Shop, more choice of opponents, a refined Popularity system, full ranking table and entrance music. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Plans</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I also have plans for a 'Downtown' expansion, which would add criminal elements like bribes, dives, illegal tonics and dodgy bets. Cushti!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*I probably won't include a ref because it would clutter up the ring without adding much to gameplay. But I appreciated the feedback.</p>","developers":["Ian Williams"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833230/90bca170f05d1436305b2eb52ac80d1e9693478a/header.jpg?t=1769092566","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04.1 LTS 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 Processor or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics card with 512MB RAM and Webgl enabled<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04.1 LTS 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 Processor or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics card with 4096MB RAM and Webgl enabled<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833230/1772009233/86b70d7ca9ee2efd5f0a6caea26a3aa477c4fabe/1768733519/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768737122","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833230/1772009233/86b70d7ca9ee2efd5f0a6caea26a3aa477c4fabe/1768733519/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768737122","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833230/1772009233/86b70d7ca9ee2efd5f0a6caea26a3aa477c4fabe/1768733519/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768737122","id":257219815,"name":"The Comeback King - Intro trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257219815/bb4e1322b562af30b077495a929e82e32b29bc8c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768737122"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833230/679299978/3b04bfc6d8fa16246a7f10c76e2e6ffb696e2f3b/1766081488/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766083174","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833230/679299978/3b04bfc6d8fa16246a7f10c76e2e6ffb696e2f3b/1766081488/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766083174","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833230/679299978/3b04bfc6d8fa16246a7f10c76e2e6ffb696e2f3b/1766081488/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766083174","id":257252246,"name":"The Comeback King - Then & Now","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257252246/9a4006a8513aa336ceac37e61265366515d6f2e2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766083174"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833230/699328520/f33ebaa7f8938b7e8962c1d45fc5bdd3d3eb0591/1766250058/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768737123","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833230/699328520/f33ebaa7f8938b7e8962c1d45fc5bdd3d3eb0591/1766250058/dash_h264.mpd?